      ],
      "justification": "Direct mapping of the faculty selection step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n5",
        "action:n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Next, identify the content that requires copyright clearance and contact the publisher to obtain clearance."
      ],
      "justification": "Splits a compound instruction into two equivalent sequential actions without changing behaviour."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n7",
        "guard:b1->n9",
        "guard:b1->n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If there is a need to \"Contact Faculty to inform of denial and ask if new content should be added\", then the process should be continued. However, if the \"Entire Course Packet Copyright Cleared\", then the MPC should Calculate the Course Packet Cost."
      ],
      "justification": "Models the conditional split. Evaluating the condition as an action followed by an XOR branch with abstract Yes/No guards preserves the decision logic."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If there is a need to \"Contact Faculty to inform of denial and ask if new content should be added\", then the process should be continued. However, if the \"Entire Course Packet Copyright Cleared\", then the MPC should Calculate the Course Packet Cost.",
        "\"Contact Faculty to inform of denial and ask if new content should be added\""
      ],
      "justification": "Represents the negative outcome path where faculty must be contacted due to denial or incomplete clearance."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If there is a need to \"Contact Faculty to inform of denial and ask if new content should be added\", then the process should be continued. However, if the \"Entire Course Packet Copyright Cleared\", then the MPC should Calculate the Course Packet Cost.",
        "if the \"Entire Course Packet Copyright Cleared\", then the MPC should Calculate the Course Packet Cost."
      ],
      "justification": "Represents the positive outcome path where clearance is complete and cost calculation proceeds."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After calculating the Course Packet Cost, the MPC should add the Bookstore margin to determine the retail price."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct mapping of the pricing step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n11",
        "guard:b2->n13",
        "guard:b2->n12"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the Faculty needs to reconsider the course packet content to decrease the price, then the process should be continued. Alternatively, if the Price of the Course Packet is finalized, then the MPC should notify the Bookstore"
      ],
      "justification": "Models the second conditional split regarding price finalization. Condition-as-action plus XOR branch and guards correctly captures the branching behaviour."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n12"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the Faculty needs to reconsider the course packet content to decrease the price, then the process should be continued. Alternatively, if the Price of the Course Packet is finalized, then the MPC should notify the Bookstore",
